[h2]3. UPDATED Puzzle Tuning & “Cheese” Warfare 🧀[/h2]
If you've been around Hard Chip for a while, you know I love seeing the creative solutions you come up with – but sometimes you're too creative and end up finding unintended shortcuts (affectionately known as "cheese"). This update continues the crusade against such exploits to keep challenges fair and square. We've identified and fixed several cheeses. The free lunch is getting harder to find!
Not only that but 2 new grade requirements were added for bonus challenges!

